00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.886 line:92%
But not a single pool. So, yeah.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.054 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-But not a single pool.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Okay. So, yes.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we put a pool
in our backyard and a Jacuzzi.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I have to say
it's best thing ever.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:27.927 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.963
Did you think you would take to
pool life right away?

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
