such a good sleep.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Great.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:38.271 line:92%
-I just love the pool lifestyle

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
