swimming with your kids.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.610
There's something about it just
really makes me feel like a mom.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's great.
-So, I love it.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just really got into
the lifestyle,

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
